<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Get Freemium Key · Zuperming</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@500;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --text: #e8eefc;
            --muted: #8b9bc4;
            --blue: #60a5fa;
            --magenta: #e11d8f;
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
            color: var(--text);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 24px;
            background:
                linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(5,7,15,0.94), rgba(10,20,55,0.9), rgba(18,8,30,0.92)),
                #05070f;
        }
        .box {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 480px;
            background: rgba(8, 12, 28, 0.85);
            border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.25);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 32px 28px;
            text-align: center;
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        }
        h1 {
            margin: 0 0 10px;
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--blue), #a78bfa, var(--magenta));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            font-size: 1.4em;
        }
        p { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; }
        code {
            display: block;
            margin-top: 18px;
            padding: 14px;
            background: rgba(5,10,24,0.9);
            border-radius: 10px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.2);
            text-align: left;
            font-size: 0.85em;
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            word-break: break-all;
        }
        a.btn {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 12px 22px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2563eb, #7c3aed);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="box">
        <h1>ZUPERMING FREEMIUM</h1>
        <p>
            Halaman Get Key Freemium.<br>
            Ambil key di sini, lalu paste ke loader Discord (<strong>Get Script</strong>).
        </p>
        <p style="font-size:0.9em;">
            Ads / auto-key generator bisa dipasang di sini nanti.<br>
            Sementara admin bisa generate key freemium via <code style="display:inline;padding:2px 6px;">/genkey</code>.
        </p>
        <code>_G.key_script = "ZFREE-XXXX"
loadstring(game:HttpGet("<%= baseUrl %>/loader/free"))()</code>
        <a class="btn" href="<%= baseUrl %>/loader/free" target="_blank">Open Freemium Loader</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
